WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.637 --> 00:00:07.775
Conflict grows in four stages, like a kettle heating up: frustration, anger, aggression, violence.

2
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.599
Frustration and anger are amber - warning.

3
00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:15.423
Aggression and violence are red - danger.

4
00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:21.796
The earlier you notice, the easier it is to cool things down.
